      "writtenOn": "2024-01-23T04:27:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As Justin mentioned, useVndk will be false once BOARD_VNDK_VERSION is unset. While BOARD_VNDK_VERSION exists, all targets with KEEP_VNDK\u003dfalse will be in the case that `IsVndkDeprecated() \u003d\u003d true` and `useVndk() \u003d\u003d true`. \n\nHowever, I expect this case to be removed in Feb.\n\nFYI, I created a new function `InVendorOrProduct()` which replaces former `UseVndk()` usage.",
      "parentUuid": "2087d0a4_d922495c",
